+ *   p3768 NVIDIA dev-kit : CAM0 is wired on CSI-B → port-index=1, serial_b
+ *   DSBOARD-ORNXS Forecr : CAM0 is wired on CSI-A → port-index=0, serial_a
+ * Keep tegra_sinterface coherent with port-index (runtime ignores sinterface
+ * but the DT must still be self-consistent for host-side integrity checks).
