+/* CAM0 lane swap corrected on carrier board (e.g. Seeed Studio reComputer J4012).
+ * CSI0_CLK (brick A) is used for CAM0, same as on DSBOARD-ORNXS but without
+ * the Forecr-specific I2C mux GPIO (TEGRA234_MAIN_GPIO Q,6).
+ * The standard devkit mux GPIO (TEGRA234_AON_GPIO CC,3) is used instead. */
